{"seq":43,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1160"},"reason":"The body said the Lutheran churches 'have held to these two [sacraments] ever since, while retaining confession as a non-sacramental practice'. The Apology of the Augsburg Confession (1531), itself a Lutheran confession, calls Baptism, the Lord's Supper and Absolution 'truly Sacraments', and Lutheranism has not been dogmatic about the number. The body now says Lutheran churches generally count two (as the EKD does) though some count three, and the notes accept 3 as an alternative answer.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://bookofconcord.org/defense/of-the-number-and-use-of-sacraments/"},{"url":"https://www.ekd.de/Sakrament-Basiswissen-Glauben-11022.htm"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lutheran_sacraments"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",710],["-","The "],["=",4],["-","have"],["+","today"],["=",1],["-","held"],["+","generally"],["=",1],["-","to"],["+","count"],["=",3],["-","two"],["+","two,"],["=",1],["-","ever"],["+","although"],["=",1],["-","since,"],["+","the"],["=",1],["-","while"],["+","Apology"],["=",1],["-","retaining"],["+","of"],["=",1],["-","confession"],["+","the"],["=",1],["-","as"],["+","Augsburg"],["=",1],["+","Confession (1531) also called absolution "],["=",2],["-","valued"],["+","sacrament,"],["=",1],["-","but"],["+","so"],["=",1],["-","non-sacramental"],["+","some"],["=",1],["-","practice."],["+","Lutherans count three."],["=",374]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",668],["-","halten"],["+","zählen"],["=",1],["-","seither"],["+","heute"],["=",1],["-","an"],["+","in"],["=",1],["-","diesen"],["+","der"],["=",1],["-","beiden"],["+","Regel"],["=",1],["-","fest"],["+","diese"],["=",1],["-","und"],["+","beiden,"],["=",1],["-","bewahren"],["+","doch"],["=",3],["-","Beichte"],["+","Apologie"],["=",1],["-","als"],["+","des"],["=",1],["-","geschätzte,"],["+","Augsburger"],["=",1],["-","aber"],["+","Bekenntnisses"],["=",1],["-","nicht"],["+","(1531)"],["=",1],["-","sakramentale"],["+","nannte"],["=",1],["-","Praxis."],["+","auch die Absolution ein Sakrament, weshalb manche Lutheraner drei zählen."],["=",356]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",584],["-","с"],["+","сегодня,"],["=",1],["-","тех"],["+","как"],["=",1],["-","пор"],["+","правило,"],["=",1],["-","придерживаются"],["+","признают"],["=",1],["-","этих"],["+","эти"],["=",1],["-","двух,"],["+","два,"],["=",1],["-","сохраняя"],["+","хотя"],["=",1],["-","исповедь"],["+","«Апология"],["=",1],["-","как"],["+","Аугсбургского"],["=",1],["-","ценную,"],["+","исповедания»"],["=",1],["-","но"],["+","(1531)"],["=",1],["-","не"],["+","называла"],["=",1],["-","сакраментальную"],["+","таинством"],["=",1],["-","практику."],["+","и отпущение грехов, поэтому некоторые лютеране насчитывают три."],["=",344]]},{"field":"notesEn","old":"","new":"Lutheran sacraments: 2 (baptism and the Lord's Supper) is the usual count; 3, adding absolution as in the Apology of the Augsburg Confession, is also accepted."},{"field":"notesDe","old":"","new":"Lutherische Sakramente: 2 (Taufe und Abendmahl) ist die übliche Zählung; 3, mit der Absolution wie in der Apologie des Augsburger Bekenntnisses, gilt ebenfalls."},{"field":"notesRu","old":"","new":"Лютеранские таинства: обычно насчитывают 2 (крещение и причастие); ответ 3 — с отпущением грехов, как в «Апологии Аугсбургского исповедания», — тоже засчитывается."}],"hash":"01c763387fc7","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"a090d0306da0e156b70217e8b257471090573583af0edb6309deb0ecb357081b"},
